      "chunk_id": "6ac55d0f-425a-4352-81c1-ccf1d238c4dd",
      "content": "Implementation Timeline\n\nThe typical implementation range is 6 to 10 weeks for standard deployments. Complex integrations or unusual data governance requirements may extend the timeline.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002005",
      "document_id": "SALES-002",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
