      ],
      "chunk_id": "68cf7775-db00-4a55-a62d-e79fab42fe38",
      "content": "SLA Targets\n\n| Customer Tier | Initial Response | Status Update Cadence | Target Resolution |\n| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: |\n| Enterprise | 1 business hour | Every 4 business hours | 2 business days |\n| Growth | 4 business hours | Every business day | 5 business days |\n| Standard | 1 business day | Every 2 business days | 10 business days |\n\nThe SLA clock starts when the customer provides enough detail to identify the affected workspace, workflow, or integration. Requests with missing identifiers should receive a clarification response, not a resolution promise.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002010",
      "document_id": "SUPPORT-001",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Sales Representative",
        "Manager"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "19356584-26af-4941-b6fe-9e95dea899e0",
      "content": "Product Limitations\n\nNorthstar is not a replacement for a system of record, identity provider, ERP, or clinical decision system. Sales Representatives should not promise unsupported integrations, exact roadmap delivery dates, or customer-specific contract commitments.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002005",
      "document_id": "SALES-002",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Sales Representative",
        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "7e7c811c-b257-4d95-8df0-3ce9978c5746",
      "content": "Escalation Triggers\n\nEscalate to Legal before signature when a contract includes uncapped liability, customer audit rights broader than annual review, unusual data residency commitments, indemnity expansion, auto-renewal longer than one year, or commitments to future roadmap functionality.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002008",
      "document_id": "LEGAL-001",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
